        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nadeem Siddique, Sugar Ray Robinson, Maha Malik\n- Organizations: Bradford City, A & B Entertainment\n- Works: Meri Ladli\n- Topics: Football, Boxing, Pakistani television drama\n\nFacts:\n- Sugar Ray Robinson, born Walker Smith Jr. on May 3, 1921, was an American professional boxer widely considered the greatest pound-for-pound boxer of all time.\n- Meri Ladli was a 2012 Pakistani romantic drama serial directed by Nadeem Siddique, written by Maha Malik, and produced by A & B Entertainment.\n- Sugar Ray Robinson died on April 12, 1989.\n- Nadeem Siddique supports his local football team Bradford City.\n- Nadeem Siddique's favorite boxer is Sugar Ray Robinson.",
